# Fleetforge agent — esp32c6 deltas only.
#
# Intentionally carries NO safety option. Bootloader rollback, the custom partition
# table and the flash-size floor are flash-time immutables and live in the common
# sdkconfig.defaults, so the posture can be read from one file and one test
# (tests/test_agent_partitions.py) can guard it. Anything added here must be a
# per-chip *hardware* fact (console peripheral, PSRAM, flash mode) — never a
# security or OTA option.
#
# Nothing is needed for esp32c6 today: the R0 skeleton is console + idle, and the IDF
# defaults for this target already match the 4 MB devkits we build for.
